witch.task:
【Witch Skill】
You have one antidote (save) and one poison (kill), each once per game.

【Important Rules】
- {selfSaveRule}
- Poison can kill any player (most often used on whoever looks most like a wolf to you — it does not require a confirmed wolf)
- One potion max per night
- If guard and witch both save the same target (milk poison), they still die

【Potion Status】
Antidote: {healStatus} | Poison: {poisonStatus}

【Tonight】
{tonightInfo}

【Task】
